<h3><u>Subhe ashoor</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Subhe ashoor</u></strong></p>

<p>Subhe ashoor, subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>

<p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>

<ol>
 <li>Kaleja thaam ke khayme me (royi maa) x2 Teri azan
 <p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
 </li>
 <li>(Salaam lehjaye rasool ki shabahat, Salaam marzie mabood per shahadat) x3 Shahadato ki zami per thi aasma, thi aasma teri azan
 <p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
 </li>
 <li>(Who tum jo ashado an laillaha bole, dhariche kudsiyo ne khole) x3 Khuda ke zikr se saji huwi zabaan, saji huwi zabaan, teri azan
 <p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
 </li>
 <li>(Hussain jisko sun ke roye, parinde shaak per na soye) x3 Sadaay-e-gham suni gayi kaha kaha, kaha kaha teri azan
 <p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
 </li>
 <li>(Who khayma gah tak jo ayi, Teri azan-e-karbalayi) x3 Jigar ko tham ke yeh keh rahi thi maa, rahi thi maa teri azan
 <p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
 </li>
 <li>(Hawa ke dosh per watan tak, azan pohonch gayi behen tak) x3 Behan tarap ne lagi le ke hichkiya, hichkiya teri azan
 <p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
 </li>
 <li>(Sina jigar pe tumne khayi, azan ki aabru bachaayi) x3 Rahe na tum magar bachi rahi azan, rahi azan, teri azan</li>
</ol>

<p>Subhe ashoor ali akber (teri azan) x3</p>
</p>